{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_8\">Problem 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/1/1e1e79ccac0cf3ec8bc24e7a3b957f572edb9637.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8\\cdot2^x = 5^{y + 8}$\" width=\"96\" height=\"15\" />, then when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/3/d6381955c126e4484f0fd6776b907307a5d79238.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = - 8,x =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"94\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/f/69ff1adda3352fd07be4565c633e97cfe677136a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ - 4 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ - 3 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"393\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simple substitution yields\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/a/d6af6b14becb25e736b1d5508e3b4439c16d4091.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[8 \\cdot 2^{x} = 5^{0}\\]\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />\nReducing the equation gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/2/0029b0b2a856bad4e423489d186011cd93e1c355.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[8 \\cdot 2^{x} = 1\\]\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />\nDividing by 8 gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/4/8a40ad1d77235bf0f7ca675e0ebab1452efc7fde.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2^{x}=\\frac{1}{8}\\]\" width=\"52\" height=\"37\" />\nThis simply gives that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/c/2fc52914d6fade6cb0f0f830a05d31585700f7ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-3$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />.\nTherefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/f/94f1cf800f01d6a55a30ef494e1d4ded508c9a05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{(B) -3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME\" title=\"1956 AHSME\">1956 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1956 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1956\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text